  ('ph-rosa-mystica-mission', 'Surgical supplies, ultrasound/EKG units and eyeglasses', 'supplies', 'ongoing', 0, 'health', false, null, '{}', 'The mission asks for sutures, scalpels, sterile drapes and gloves, ultrasound and EKG machines, and prescription eyeglasses for its free clinics in Mindanao.

