  ('ph-rosa-mystica-mission', 'Fund medicines and year-round patient follow-up', 'funding', 'ongoing', 0, 'health', false, null, '{}', 'Gifts pay for medicines, procedures and follow-up care that Filipino volunteers provide all year after the annual mission week, which serves more than 2,000 patients.

