  ('ph-ancop-medical-mission', 'Medicines and supplies for 2027 medical mission', 'funding', 'soon', 0, 'health', false, 'one-off gift', '{}', 'ANCOP is planning another Philippine medical mission in 2027 and is raising funds to buy medicines and medical supplies; the site has not been announced.

